Ultimately, if you prioritize acausality as the essence of our genesis, cycles do feel additive. But they persist in research because they unify the emulated conditions (hot start, inflation-like smoothing) with resolutions to unresolved problems, keeping cosmology open-ended. If upcoming data (e.g., from CMB-S4 or Euclid) spots bounce echoes, it could validate them\'97or reinforce the singular brute fact. Either way, no turtles needed. 
