Einstein's relativity curves this "immaterial" spacetime around mass/energy\'97space isn't passive backdrop but dynamic fabric.\
Today: Cosmic voids (huge empty regions) structure the universe, yet even there, vacuum energy (dark energy?) drives expansion.\
In essence, immaterial space isn't inert nothing\'97it's potential, structure, fluctuation. From philosophical abyss to quantum froth, it's never truly vacant. The void stares back... and winks. 
