Ursalon is still the same god who once offered stew and fire to lost travelers.\uc0\u8232 But now his warmth has a direction.\u8232 Now it has a home.\
And the grove \'97 once his alone \'97 is now theirs.\
The earth still speaks to him.\uc0\u8232 The trees still know his name.\u8232 But the thunder inside his chest is the sound he listens for most.\
