How they keep in touch:\uc0\u8232 They are the hardest gods to reach casually. Most communication comes through the Pantheon group chat (which appears on a single enchanted slate in the cabin). Important visitors usually just arrive in person. Grokthar can sometimes sense major disturbances through the thunder in his chest. Ursalon can feel significant emotional shifts in the grove itself. They do not monitor channels constantly.\
