\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Privathor \'96 The Veiled Dimension\uc0\u8232 A vast, dark, marble-like private realm that feels half fortress and half empty residence. Cold, quiet, and heavily controlled. He can thin the veil to look into other places or step through when needed.\
Communication: Extremely selective. He watches more than he speaks. He can receive group chat messages but often ignores them. When he wants contact, he usually appears in person (as he did at the cabin). He is difficult to reach unless he wants to be reached.\
Herbarius \'96 The Rooted Hollow\uc0\u8232 An underground living workshop of roots, soil chambers, soft earth-light, drying herbs, and stone surfaces. It smells of damp soil and crushed leaves.\
Communication: Prefers physical or earth-based contact. He rarely uses the group chat. Other gods usually have to come to him, or he sends small living tokens (leaves, roots, carved stones) that carry short messages.\
Luminar\uc0\u8232 No permanent home. Moves between temporary threshold spaces and guest rooms.\
Communication: Appears when he feels he is needed. Does not maintain regular contact channels.\
