That conflict is real. A system optimized for understanding will eventually pressure any process to become fully representable. A practice oriented toward Worship will resist full representability precisely because total legibility would collapse the openness being valued. The Facility\'92s drive to stabilize knowledge and Worship\'92s drive to preserve the possibility of another encounter are therefore not merely different preferences; they are structurally opposed orientations toward recursion.\
